# URLS 
@dns = http://localhost:11434
@models = {{dns}}/api/tags
@chat = {{dns}}/v1/chat/completions

### ROOT
GET {{dns}}

### MODELS
GET {{models}}

### CHAT
POST {{chat}}
Content-Type: application/json

